  "title": "Vanilla Bavarian Cream Pie",
  "description": "For the lovely filling in this cream pie, vanilla ice cream and whipped cream is stirred into a cooked egg custard. This heavenly filling is then poured into a baked crust and chilled. Top this rich pie with lightly sugared strawberries.",
  "authors": [
    "ETHELMERTZ"
